00 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i>pure essence</i> to build different buildings, which will produce better offerings, accumulating more essence faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/3706ad091b9598f6156a4270e6b56bac.avif?t=1756393647\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use essence and <i>pure essence</i> to improve your offerings - like higher essence yield or unique effects. Some upgrades allow offerings to interact with each other, creating unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Pixel Font: Adventurer by Brian J Smith - CC-BY)</i></p>","developers":["Elifam"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/7353c16868bb00c537da366f1e4d903a0d98f454/header.jpg?t=1756393647","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183727,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183727/movie480.mp4?t=1755838911","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183727/movie_max.mp4?t=1755838911"},"name":"Feed the Greed","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183727/ea4da263b316e30e628aea7e896889c64a236646/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755838911","webm":{